1
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:21,070
Godfather.

2
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:24,400
Wen Jianan has been running Wen Group
for 1 month.

3
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,430
Xingji Entertainment Complex
project is advancing rapidly.

4
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:27,790
What's your next move?

5
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:31,230
Let her enjoy this position
for a little longer.

6
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:35,070
Treat it as her reward for getting rid of
Wen Yanhui for me.

7
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,240
I've said it before.

8
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,770
Wen Group will be mine sooner or later.

9
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:56,040
Old man, you want your medicine, huh?

10
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,310
I've got it right here.

11
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,860
Here, take one.

12
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:04,230
Open your mouth.

13
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:06,710
Come on, open up.

14
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:09,810
Swallow it.

15
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:12,710
Almost done, swallow.

16
00:01:13,230 --> 00:01:14,150
Swallow.

17
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,580
Just a moment, it'll pass.

18
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:17,789
Swallow.

19
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:24,610
Wen Group belongs to me.

20
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,710
But she won't hold that seat

21
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:56,000
for much longer.

22
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:03,040
This is

23
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:05,280
a miracle drug to keep women young.

24
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,680
But I've added something inside it.

25
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:10,590
Something addictive and
impossible to quit.

26
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:12,830
With just this tiny amount,

27
00:02:12,830 --> 00:02:15,230
it will push Wen Jianan straight
to rock bottom,

28
00:02:15,230 --> 00:02:18,310
and bring Wen Group back under my control.

29
00:02:21,079 --> 00:02:22,150
Do rest assured.

30
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:26,470
I promised to get your mother treated.

31
00:02:26,530 --> 00:02:28,210
I keep my word.

32
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:33,070
As long as you help me take back
Wen Group,

33
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:37,040
I'll give you whatever you want.

34
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:39,410
Understood, Godfather.

35
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:42,090
[Dearest Episode 20]

36
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:56,960
Xin, you've got a new hairstyle today.

37
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,310
It's more playful than your last look.

38
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:00,640
It suits you perfectly.

39
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:04,290
You switched your perfume too, didn't you?

40
00:03:04,290 --> 00:03:06,890
Your old Apple Brandy was bolder.

41
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:09,450
Is it Silver Mountain Water today?

42
00:03:09,650 --> 00:03:11,220
You know your stuff.

43
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,910
Well?

44
00:03:13,230 --> 00:03:16,160
Aren't they great at delivering
emotional comfort?

45
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:19,740
You're the boss of Cloudsea now.

46
00:03:20,150 --> 00:03:22,140
You never try the services yourself.

47
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:25,260
How can you pitch to clients
if you don't experience it?

48
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:26,360
Cut it out.

49
00:03:26,990 --> 00:03:28,860
I've been in the entertainment industry
for years.

50
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:30,650
I've seen every kind there is.

51
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:34,329
My dear Ms. Wen,

52
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,540
you still don't get it, do you?

53
00:03:37,030 --> 00:03:38,390
A-list celebrities like you,

54
00:03:38,390 --> 00:03:40,790
you let others admire how
dazzling you are.

55
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,840
But the staff here,

56
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:45,550
they make you feel like you're
the one shining bright.

57
00:03:45,550 --> 00:03:47,190
Looks aren't what matters most.

58
00:03:47,190 --> 00:03:49,500
It's emotion, it's the vibe.

59
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,930
It's whether they can make you feel

60
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,520
that you are the one and only

61
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:55,260
person in this world.

62
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:59,040
Go, give Ms. Wen your best service.

63
00:04:08,510 --> 00:04:10,440
Seems like I showed up at a bad time.

64
00:04:12,970 --> 00:04:16,079
Someone's already keeping
Miss Wen company.

65
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,720
Well, well, Alex.

66
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,560
I didn't expect

67
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:28,220
to see you without booking
the Cloudview Suite.

68
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,840
Quite fitting,

69
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:34,070
on this good day marking my 1-month
takeover of Wen Group.

70
00:04:41,650 --> 00:04:42,980
Congratulations, Ms. Wen.

71
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:44,510
Whatever you ask for today,

72
00:04:45,350 --> 00:04:46,610
will be fully granted.

73
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,060
Today's theme is:

74
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,360
make me happy.

75
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,600
Doesn't Mr. Alex

76
00:04:58,970 --> 00:05:01,000
have any gift for me?

77
00:05:03,630 --> 00:05:04,600
Of course I do.

78
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:15,950
I had a chalet built for you
in Switzerland,

79
00:05:16,790 --> 00:05:18,230
right up in the Alps.

80
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:20,710
You can go skiing right out the door.

81
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:23,840
Hopefully we can go there
together someday.

82
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:27,020
How did you know I wanted to ski?

83
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:29,950
You posted on Weibo 2 years ago,

84
00:05:30,530 --> 00:05:32,640
saying you wanted to ski in Switzerland,

85
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:34,300
and stay in a mountain chalet.

86
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,270
With a bit of luck,

87
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:39,250
you could catch the Northern Lights
at night.

88
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,120
After I read that post,

89
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:43,870
I started making arrangements.

90
00:05:52,790 --> 00:05:54,390
Back when you shot for Vogue,

91
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,920
you mentioned you loved Bordeaux wine.

92
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:00,740
So I acquired a winery

93
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:03,050
in Pauillac, Southern France.

94
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:04,630
From now on,

95
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:07,450
the winery will bear your name.

96
00:06:08,250 --> 00:06:11,610
Your name will be printed on every bottle.

97
00:06:12,350 --> 00:06:14,150
You're welcome to come taste it.

98
00:06:18,350 --> 00:06:20,750
Looks like no matter how
many gifts I bring,

99
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:24,000
none can compare to Alex's
affection for Jianan.

100
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:27,850
Waiter, wrap all of these up.

101
00:06:28,370 --> 00:06:29,830
I'm taking the gifts back.

102
00:06:29,990 --> 00:06:32,080
I'm keeping them for myself.

103
00:06:33,090 --> 00:06:35,200
Come on, dear sister.

104
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,830
Don't be like that.

105
00:06:38,990 --> 00:06:41,640
Then I lose no matter what gifts I offer.

106
00:06:42,290 --> 00:06:43,800
You haven't lost.

107
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:46,690
I love all your gifts.

108
00:06:50,350 --> 00:06:51,350
Alex,

109
00:06:52,270 --> 00:06:54,420
you win today.

110
00:06:55,830 --> 00:06:57,630
But I've got one more thing to do.

111
00:06:58,080 --> 00:07:00,280
Everything’s on me today.

112
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,360
Payment successful.

113
00:07:17,670 --> 00:07:19,730
You won't be paying the bill tonight.

114
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,000
Alex,

115
00:07:21,550 --> 00:07:23,960
I can't compete with your love for Jianan.

116
00:07:24,750 --> 00:07:26,750
But when it comes to protecting her,

117
00:07:26,770 --> 00:07:28,330
I will never back down.

118
00:07:29,670 --> 00:07:30,550
Miss Wen Xin,

119
00:07:31,610 --> 00:07:32,470
very generous.

120
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:34,970
Alright.

121
00:07:35,230 --> 00:07:37,790
I'll take all the gifts from both of you.

122
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:42,480
And I'll take your affection too.

123
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:47,680
To those who love me, and those I love.

124
00:07:48,550 --> 00:07:49,350
Cheers.

125
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,670
Uncle Long.

126
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:22,920
Uncle Long.

127
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,590
I should've picked you up upon
your release from prison.

128
00:08:25,590 --> 00:08:28,880
But my current status
makes it inappropriate.

129
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:32,169
I wouldn't hold that against you.

130
00:08:32,429 --> 00:08:34,120
You work for me.

131
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:37,120
Just focus on getting your job done.

132
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,390
Of course.

133
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:41,159
I've already laid all the groundwork.

134
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,000
Here.

135
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,000
This beauty product

136
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,870
will launch under Wen Group very soon.

137
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:51,870
It targets the high-end women's market.

138
00:08:55,870 --> 00:08:56,670
That's it?

139
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,790
Uncle Long,

140
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:05,600
we can't only sell this to
existing addicts.

141
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:07,790
I've been in this game a long time.

142
00:09:07,790 --> 00:09:09,600
You know what I value most?

143
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:12,370
Expanding the consumer base.

144
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:15,390
Who brings in the biggest profits?

145
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,410
Women.

146
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:19,790
And what do women care about most?

147
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:24,230
Beauty and figure.

148
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:25,510
All I need to do is,

149
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:27,600
mix a tiny extra substance

150
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,330
into this beauty moisturizer.

151
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:32,640
Standard drug tests won't pick it up.

152
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,720
But the profit?

153
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,600
It will multiply several times over.

154
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,390
Really?

155
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:37,930
Absolutely.

156
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:39,840
Once this product

157
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:42,390
blows up among wealthy socialite women,

158
00:09:42,410 --> 00:09:44,590
and when powerful, well-connected women

159
00:09:44,590 --> 00:09:46,250
can no longer live without it.

160
00:09:46,410 --> 00:09:48,210
What about women without money?

161
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,600
They will chase the trend.

162
00:09:50,780 --> 00:09:52,210
They will dip into their savings

163
00:09:52,210 --> 00:09:54,450
to buy a chance to become beautiful.

164
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:57,320
Then everything blows up.

165
00:09:57,480 --> 00:10:01,030
Scandals, fatalities, official seizures.

166
00:10:01,260 --> 00:10:03,620
The powerful forces behind those women

167
00:10:03,650 --> 00:10:05,100
will come down hard on Wen Group.

168
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:07,500
Wen Group will crash to rock bottom.

169
00:10:07,550 --> 00:10:09,320
That's when we make our acquisition.

170
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,910
Uncle Long, Wen Group will be ours then.

171
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,790
Ours...

172
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:18,070
Forgive my loose tongue.

173
00:10:18,970 --> 00:10:21,010
Yours. Everything will be yours.

174
00:10:21,490 --> 00:10:23,850
Even my worthless life belongs to you.

175
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:32,720
I'll wait for your good news.

176
00:10:33,170 --> 00:10:36,340
Don't let me down.

177
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,620
Take care, Uncle Long.

178
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,800
It’s neither yours nor mine.

179
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:59,090
Wen Group is mine, and mine only.
